SET UTF-8
TRY abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
COMPOUNDFLAG X
COMPOUNDBEGIN b
COMPOUNDMIDDLE m
COMPOUNDEND e
COMPOUNDPERMITFLAG P
COMPOUNDFORBIDFLAG F
COMPOUNDROOT R
COMPOUNDMIN 2
COMPOUNDWORDMAX 3
CHECKCOMPOUNDDUP
CHECKCOMPOUNDREP
CHECKCOMPOUNDTRIPLE
SIMPLIFIEDTRIPLE
CHECKCOMPOUNDCASE
ONLYINCOMPOUND O
NEEDAFFIX N
FORBIDDENWORD W
REP 2
REP ss s
REP ie y
PFX A Y 1
PFX A 0 un/P .
SFX S Y 2
SFX S 0 s/P [^y]
SFX S y ies/P y
SFX T N 1
SFX T 0 ed/F .
